    "name": "18. Notice",
    "text": "18. Notice. Any notice or other communication permitted or required under the terms hereof shall be in writing and, unless otherwise specified, be deemed property given on the date personally delivered and/or received by the addressee. Notices mailed shall be sent by postage prepaid United States certified mail, return receipt requested, addressed to Lessor or Lessee at the address set forth, as follows, or to such other address as may hereafter be designated by either party to the other by written notice. Notice given in any other manner shall be effective only if and when received. 1. Lessor: Dorchester Minerals, L.P. 3838 Oak Lawn Avenue, Suite 300 Dallas, Texas 75219 2. Lessee: Chesapeake Exploration Limited Partnership 6100 N. Western Ave. Oklahoma City, Oklahoma 73118"
  },
  {
